<title>MOROCCO: TENNIS-GRAND PRIX HASSAN II FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAND PRIX HASSAN II FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Grand Prix Hassan II men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Gerard Solves (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Marcello Craca (Germany) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Vicente Fernando (Spain) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 7-6 (7-0) 6-1</p>
<p>7-Oliver Gross (Germany) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Franco Squillari (Argentina) beat 3-Roberto Carretero (Spain) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Juan Antonio Marin (Spain) beat Larbi Gharnit (Morocco) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>6-Thomas Carbonell (Spain) beat Thomas Nydhal (Sweden) 6-2 4-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Bernardo Mota (Portugal) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) 6-0 1-6 6-2</p>
<p>Alberto Martin (Spain) beat Francisco Roig (Spain) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>4-Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Tamer El Sawy (Egypt) 7-6 (7-2) 6-3</p>
<p>8-Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Mounir El Aarej (Morocco) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Lars Jonsson (Sweden) beat Jordi Buricco (Spain) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>David Skoch (Czech Republic) beat Mehdi Tahiri (Morocco)  6-1 6-2</p>
<p>2-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Jozsef Kroscko (Hungary) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco) beat Oleg Ogorodov (Uzbekistan) 6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>5-Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Orlin Stanoytchev (Bulgaria) 6-7 (4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
